  "body": "Perfectly positioned in a family-friendly neighbourhood and within the sought-after Long Bay College zone, this brand-new affordable townhouse is an excellent opportunity for first-home buyers, young families, or smart investors.\r\n\r\nLocated just moments from Torbay School, this property is ideal for families with children, offering convenience, great schooling, and an easy lifestyle. Nearby shops, beaches, parks, cafés, and motorway access further add to the appeal.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n* Brand-new modern townhouse\r\n* 3 bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms\r\n* Master bedroom with ensuite\r\n* Single internal-access garage\r\n* Low-maintenance easy-care living\r\n* Plenty of street parking nearby\r\n* Walking distance to Torbay School\r\n* In zone for Long Bay College\r\n* Close to beaches, shops, cafés, and public transport\r\n* Affordable opportunity in a popular North Shore location\r\n\r\nWhether you are looking to step onto the property ladder or secure a quality home in an excellent school zone, Lot 2, 50 Alexander Avenue is a must-see.\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing.\r\n\r\nTo view or download property files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/88YR",
